ate>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"authorized\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">Authorized</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"authorized\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">Autorisiert</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"sandbox\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">Sandbox</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"sandbox\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">Sandbox</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"sandbox-note\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">Requests go to the sandbox in this page</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"sandbox-note\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">Anfragen gehen an die Sandbox in dieser Seite</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"v3-title\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">You are reading v3</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"v3-title\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">Sie lesen v3</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"v3-text\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\"\n    >v3 stops answering on 31 March 2027. The samples call /v3 - switch to v4 for new work.</template\n  >\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"v3-text\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\"\n    >v3 antwortet ab dem 31. März 2027 nicht mehr. Die Beispiele rufen /v3 auf - nutzen Sie v4 für Neues.</template\n  >\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"crumb-reference\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">API reference</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"crumb-reference\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">API-Referenz</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"crumb-reference-2\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">API reference</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"crumb-reference-2\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">API-Referenz</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"h-endpoints\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">Endpoints</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"h-endpoints\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">Endpunkte</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"h-responses\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">Responses</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"h-responses\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">Antworten</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"h-try\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">Try it</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"h-try\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">Ausprobieren</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"try-text\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\"\n    >Change a value - the samples follow. Send runs the request against the sandbox.</template\n  >\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"try-text\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\"\n    >Ändern Sie einen Wert - die Beispiele folgen. Senden schickt die Anfrage an die Sandbox.</template\n  >\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"send\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">Send request</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"send\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">Anfrage senden</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"reset\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">Reset</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"reset\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">Zurücksetzen</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"h-response\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">Response</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"h-response\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">Antwort</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"response-empty\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\"\n    >Send the request to see the sandbox's answer.</template\n  >\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"response-empty\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\"\n    >Senden Sie die Anfrage, um die Antwort der Sandbox zu sehen.</template\n  >\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"find-empty\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">Nothing found.</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"find-empty\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">Nichts gefunden.</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"key-title\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">Authorize</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"key-title\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">Autorisieren</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"key-text\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\"\n    >Requests carry the key as a bearer token. The sandbox takes any test key that starts with acme_test_.</template\n  >\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"key-text\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\"\n    >Anfragen tragen den Schlüssel als Bearer-Token. Die Sandbox nimmt jeden Testschlüssel, der mit acme_test_\n    beginnt.</template\n  >\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"key-label\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">API key</template>\n